    "notes": "Model pricing verified from Replicate pricing pages. Dimensional ratings (1-100) based on art-styles-and-model-selection.md research: photorealism (material accuracy, lighting realism), artistic_quality (creative expression, style range), consistency (brand reliability, reproducibility), speed (iteration capability), style_versatility (genre/use-case flexibility). Cost-efficiency = calculated value (higher is better)."
